     1,
     "Here&#39;s my GIST example of (HTML5) how to link URL elements to input elements bi-directionally.<div><br></div><div>You can edit the page or the URL, and both are updated.  No refresh required.  Also you can bookmark or email the link and it will configure the inputs.<br><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/alexbbrown/6e77383b48a044191771\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/alexbbrown/6e77383b48a044191771&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409819337000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-BEJYI778aVwkpjRkfGRN\">https://gist.github.com/alexbbrown/6e77383b48a044191771</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>To test, </div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">require(shiny)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">runGist(&quot;6e77383b48a044191771&quot;)</font><br></div><div><br></div><div>Note: this was a quick hack, if it kills your auntie or melts tibet it&#39;s not my fault.</div><div><br></div><div>-Alex</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-kJRZGS8BIm0/UR6w6U8sVaI/AAAAAAAAAUs/on3-zDjgfCM/s1600/screenshot.PNG\" style=\"margin-right:1em;margin-left:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-kJRZGS8BIm0/UR6w6U8sVaI/AAAAAAAAAUs/on3-zDjgfCM/s1600/screenshot.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409819337000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nP7kE6BMpOxoGFTv8WjDC\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-kJRZGS8BIm0/UR6w6U8sVaI/AAAAAAAAAUs/on3-zDjgfCM/s320/screenshot.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\"></a></p></div><div><br></div>"
